# QA ROB-1: saves into a read-only user-data dir (prepared by the caller: data dir chmod 555,
# logs/ writable) → the game keeps running and shows the save-failed toast; nothing crashes.
wait ui
3.5 nav keyboardA confirm          # Title
1.5 nav keyboardA up
0.3 nav keyboardA up
0.3 nav keyboardA up               # Settings
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm
2.0 nav keyboardA right            # speed unit: a settings save (≤ 1/s)
1.5 shot sf_01_after_setting_change
2.0 shot sf_02_later
0.3 nav keyboardA right            # change again: the retry
1.5 shot sf_03_retry
0.3 nav keyboardA back
1.0 exit
